NOTE:
  This file is read out line by line.  There  are two sorts of lines.
    1. Commentary, Format: free
    2. Names of directories, Format:
	 [SBM: absolute name]

	 "S" means source-directories,
	 "B" means binary-directories,
	 "M" means manual-directories

I. BINARY DIRECTORIES:

B: /etc
B: /bin
B: /usr/bin
B: /usr/lbin
B: /usr/lib
B: /usr/lib/uucp
B: /usr/lib/acct
B: /usr/ucb
B: /usr/games



